From b71f3d6d3f54a7ab6124cadcab929fec43d40a06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:43:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 294/350] Engine field test fixes: crossing outlines, scripted
 patterns, the constraint list, recovery, long bolts

- PartDesign: closed outlines of a sketch that cross each other (a
  connecting rod's eyes and web) are joined, the ones inside another cut
  out; the pad was only a part of the shape without a word.
- PartDesign: a mirror or pattern made by a script becomes the part's end
  and gets its base once it has its originals (it looked like a step of a
  MultiTransform when added): the next step no longer splits the part.
- Sketcher: a row of the constraint list left by a constraint that is gone
  (a dimension cancelled with Esc) no longer crashes on a double-click; the
  list is filled again.
- Recovery data every 2 minutes (was 15); the first-start choice is kept
  at once (a crash brought the first-start questions back).
- Parts shelf: longer than the standard table, the needed length is made
  (rounded up to 5 mm) and said, with stud bolts as the other way.

Tests: FreeCADCmd -t TestPartDesignFixes, -t TestPartsShelf

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
